<description><![CDATA[<div>中国社科院11月6日举行仪式，在社科大设立“冷门绝学学院”，以响应<a href="http://news.xinhuanet.com/politics/2016-05/18/c_1118891128_4.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">习近平讲话</a>。该院主要研究突厥文、西夏文、契丹文、女真文等民族古文字和简帛古文献，旨在服务边疆长治久安，维护文化安全，夯实文明自主阐释根基。<br/>（<a href="https://www.ucass.edu.cn/info/1073/5906.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国社会科学院大学</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/WhhJ9TXOZkLndO9PeiL848mjxOl1gFn-ZwvZAU3LgJGhew0UHXrVqTKaeGOeel1HMTA0oXYwA4kYl-KZV3V92scOxO3_KKl-ljbH5IRn_Sd4Ojffdv7IjgPJ_8oh35QtGOCJszVCS5kLg0683SFWXS_JEO5dkh4Nw-IT2jcx9x2I0JAxuTl3bILIC-GH1I30GU6-R0VZFqcZ0H7ydayY00LIBQugSwREkvt9fK3vC1UywptcOqKHTN0Mx8jBsnUfE7sbepnZqVYNwb6fGGaPsLf45AXC972HJkTdGsYOam7jyVrmEGXa930pAmnVxhiKDn4Z-Y3vBpZ2d8485WrQGw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
